# RevOS Terms of Service — Production Implementation Specification V1.0

## 1. Project Objective

I am developing RevOS, an AI-native Revenue Operating System designed to help business users improve go-to-market strategy, lead qualification, opportunity assessment, pipeline management, SWOT analysis and revenue decision-making.

I want you to inspect the existing RevOS codebase and implement a professional, production-quality **Terms of Service page** accessible through the Terms of Service link in the website footer.

The Terms of Service must establish the contractual framework governing access to and use of the RevOS platform.

This is not a request to create a generic SaaS Terms of Service template.

You must first understand the actual RevOS application, product functionality, user registration process, subscription model, AI integrations, customer data handling, platform architecture and commercial arrangements.

The Terms must accurately reflect how RevOS operates.

**Critical principle: Never invent legal entities, commercial terms, subscription arrangements, refund policies, service guarantees, intellectual property rights, liability commitments or contractual obligations that cannot be verified.**

The implementation must preserve the existing RevOS architecture, functionality, design system and application behavior.

