## 12. Implementation Workflow

Follow this sequence.

**Stage 1 — Inspect**

Examine the repository, actual product functionality, user registration, commercial model and legal-page architecture.

**Stage 2 — Audit**

Produce the contractual audit report and identify verified, unverified and owner-dependent information.

**Stage 3 — Draft**

Prepare the Terms of Service content based on verified facts and clearly identified owner decisions.

**Stage 4 — Design**

Build the Terms page using the existing RevOS design system.

**Stage 5 — Implement**

